    "method": "Soft nearest-artery assignment: softmax(-d/sigma) over the distances from each heart-wall vertex to the LAD (+septal), LCX and RCA (+marginal, PDA, posterolateral, septal) groups, sigma = 7.0 mm, faded to zero on atria and great-vessel roots (thin wall and closer to inflow/outflow vessels than to ventricular landmarks) and far from every artery.",
